COS).", "c": 1, "w": 1241.4473876953125}, {"h": 63.00000000000022, "x": 119.83085277652162, "w": 1553.0074462890623, "c": 1, "t": "3. Part II comprises questions which require descriptive type answers.", "y": 862.9999999810082}, {"c": 1, "x": 119.65232907147652, "w": 1965.6043701171877, "h": 70.22945022583004, "t": "4. Ensure that you receive the question paper relating to both the parts. If you have not", "y": 919.4852946354731}, {"x": 200.92581119054432, "y": 981.1183651116648, "c": 1, "w": 1165.427978515625, "h": 73.48715972900386, "t": "received both, bring it to the notice of the invigilator."}, {"t": "5. Answers to MCQs in Part I are to be marked on the OMR answer sheet as given on the", "c": 1, "y": 1050.0000000697219, "x": 119.83085372195184, "w": 1965.2254638671873, "h": 63.00000000000022}, {"x": 200.9077649236924, "y": 1099.2917948758604, "t": "cover page of descriptive answer book only. Answers to questions in Part II are to be", "c": 1, "h": 82.9132461547852, "w": 1884.4970703125}, {"c": 1, "t": "written in the same descriptive answer book. Answers to MCQs, if written inside the", "x": 206.10902857715564, "y": 1165.5523262199367, "w": 1878.9473876953125, "h": 67.44767379760745}, {"h": 62.499998092651296, "c": 1, "t": "descriptive answer book, will not be evaluated.", "w": 992.1992187499999, "y": 1237.500001226395, "x": 206.10904964403164}, {"t": "6. OMR answer sheet given on the cover page of descriptive answer book will be in", "w": 1960.7434082031252, "h": 67.49333190917952, "x": 119.68381048851438, "c": 1, "y": 1294.887020592914}, {"h": 68.57749938964852, "c": 1, "t": "English only for all candidates, including for Hindi medium candidates.", "w": 1562.8858642578127, "y": 1356.9661819314238, "x": 205.93820455349294}, {"x": 119.83085743670745, "c": 1, "y": 1424.5639550145488, "t": "7. The bar coded sticker provided in the attendance register, is to be affixed only", "h": 62.43604469299323, "w": 1965.2254638671875}, {"t": "on the descriptive answer book.", "c": 1, "x": 206.10901975189438, "y": 1491.7151168654757, "w": 738.1578979492188, "h": 57.5581398010253}, {"h": 78.36931228637718, "t": "8. You will be allowed to leave the examination hall only after the conclusion of the", "x": 119.53248426737923, "c": 1, "y": 1538.8240332689013, "w": 1965.8588867187495}, {"y": 1606.8313959074367, "w": 1878.9473876953125, "h": 67.16860580444336, "c": 1, "x": 206.10902857715564, "t": "exam. If you have completed the paper before time, remain in your seat till the"}, {"h": 58.0174407958986, "x": 206.10904095894023, "c": 1, "t": "conclusion of the exam.", "w": 527.255615234375, "y": 1673.9825587259409}, {"h": 67.3644409179688, "t": "9. Duration of the examination is 3 hours. You will be required to submit (a) Part I of", "c": 1, "y": 1731.469576006776, "w": 1970.3121337890627, "x": 119.70553867269064}, {"x": 201.31581548681243, "y": 1793.8953487962447, "w": 1888.5338134765623, "h": 67.15116119384784, "t": "the question paper containing MCQs, and (b) the answer book in respect of", "c": 1}, {"h": 67.40116119384761, "t": "descriptive answer book with OMR cover page to the invigilator before leaving the", "c": 1, "w": 1878.947387695313, "x": 206.10902634031368, "y": 1856.0000005243387}, {"w": 958.6466064453125, "y": 1923.0000001964195, "t": "exam hall, after the conclusion of the exam.", "c": 1, "x": 206.109030600182, "h": 63.00000000000022}, {"x": 124.62412458103222, "t": "10. The invigilator will give you acknowledgement on Page 2 of the admit card, upon", "y": 1985.755814940058, "c": 1, "h": 62.354648590087926, "w": 1960.4322509765627}, {"w": 834.0225219726562, "c": 1, "h": 62.46511459350583, "x": 201.31580016404791, "t": "receipt of the above-mentioned items.", "y": 2047.9999997756659}, {"c": 1, "w": 1965.6226806640627, "x": 124.44567635871567, "h": 74.03432464599605, "y": 2105.567684176298, "t": "11. Candidate found copying or receiving or giving any help or defying instructions of"}, {"c": 1, "y": 2167.9999986429757, "h": 67.17441940307623, "w": 1883.7406005859375, "t": "the invigilators will be expelled from the examination and will also be liable for", "x": 201.31577423475707}, {"c": 1, "x": 201.31579522387528, "w": 512.8759155273438, "y": 2239.9709302194005, "h": 58.02906990051261, "t": "further punitive action."}, {"y": 2349.9697430568294, "w": 230.20834350585926, "x": 1854.9146266770144, "h": 48.607023239135735, "t": "70 Marks", "c": 1}, {"t": "PART - II", "x": 1006.53098755934, "w": 249.3440399169922, "y": 2350.0635112986556, "c": 1, "h": 53.215999603271555}, {"w": 1956.1395263671875, "t": "1. Question paper comprises 6 questions. Answer Question No. 1 which is compulsory", "h": 74.80734252929659, "c": 1, "x": 124.37146599024936, "y": 2430.008877324494}, {"h": 58.00000000000001, "t": "and any 4 out of the remaining 5 questions.", "w": 949.0601196289064, "y": 2512.9999996895012, "x": 234.8684459167498, "c": 1}, {"t": "2. Working notes should form part of the answer.", "y": 2609.0000006173887, "h": 62.99999999999986, "c": 1, "x": 119.83086096220018, "w": 1140.7894287109375}, {"w": 1970.018798828125, "t": "3. Answers to the questions are to be given only in English except in the case of", "c": 1, "y": 2705.0000004316325, "x": 119.83081383723015, "h": 63.00000000000022}, {"t": "candidates who have opted for Hindi Medium. If a candidate has not opted for Hindi", "c": 1, "w": 1850.6341552734375, "h": 69.68901824951172, "y": 2776.8005997981986, "x": 234.65900028900887}, {"x": 234.67391444804196, "h": 68.79220199584964, "t": "Medium, his/her answers in Hindi will not be evaluated.", "y": 2853.2120195024095, "w": 1232.2076416015627, "c": 1}, {"c": 1, "t": "P.T.O.", "y": 2988.2267453696154, "x": 1907.7067730257677, "w": 172.5563812255858, "h": 62.354648590087926}, {"x": 977.2065069754949, "t": "RYW2(H)", "y": 2990.188416567581, "w": 255.26744079589838, "h": 63.227817535400455, "c": 1}, {"t": "\u00a9 The Institute of Chartered Accountants of India", "y": 3156.0000008846973, "c": 1, "h": 34.000